WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.239
Nazism arrived via democratic channels

00:00:02.319 --> 00:00:05.439
and it is because we let certain ideas spread,

00:00:05.599 --> 00:00:08.279
because we did not know how to denounce this evil,

00:00:08.359 --> 00:00:10.959
that it went on to become absolute evil.

00:00:16.639 --> 00:00:18.639
I was brought up by parents who regretted

00:00:18.919 --> 00:00:21.039
the failure of a European project,

00:00:21.119 --> 00:00:25.399
a first project - that of Briand and Stresemann.

00:00:25.479 --> 00:00:26.759
I often thought that,

00:00:26.839 --> 00:00:29.159
had Briand and Stresemann been listened to,

00:00:29.399 --> 00:00:31.959
I would never have found myself in Auschwitz.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:37.439
For me the only hope was Europe, reconciliation.

00:00:37.679 --> 00:00:39.519
I wished for this reconciliation,

00:00:39.759 --> 00:00:43.079
because I felt deeply that so much hatred,

00:00:43.159 --> 00:00:47.479
so much barbarity, could only lead to a third world war.

00:00:48.519 --> 00:00:52.639
European construction remains the most important event

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.199
of the past 50 years.

00:00:54.839 --> 00:00:59.199
It's Europe that has changed our destiny,

00:00:59.279 --> 00:01:02.559
our hope and confidence for the future.

00:01:03.079 --> 00:01:05.439
We cannot have any tolerance

00:01:05.839 --> 00:01:08.959
towards those who express ideas of exclusion,

00:01:09.199 --> 00:01:11.519
of racism and xenophobia.

00:01:11.599 --> 00:01:15.359
This should be the role of all educators, at all levels.

00:01:15.759 --> 00:01:17.439
It is also incumbent upon historians,

00:01:17.519 --> 00:01:21.239
because I do not believe that we have learned from history,

00:01:21.399 --> 00:01:23.239
from what history has taught us.

00:01:23.799 --> 00:01:25.959
There were things, written in logic,

00:01:26.199 --> 00:01:31.039
that we didn't want to see between 1933 and 1940.

00:01:31.399 --> 00:01:34.839
By the time we took them seriously it was too late,

00:01:35.079 --> 00:01:36.279
but we knew all along.

00:01:36.479 --> 00:01:38.199
That's the lesson,

00:01:38.279 --> 00:01:43.079
the lesson for history and for Europe is to keep building.

00:01:45.879 --> 00:01:48.999
I think the European Parliament is already considering

00:01:49.159 --> 00:01:55.959
whether the European Union should have its own legal framework,

00:01:56.039 --> 00:02:01.519
a symbolic declaration of human rights

00:02:01.599 --> 00:02:03.359
at the heart of the EU.

00:02:03.519 --> 00:02:07.199
It could be a model and an example.

00:02:07.279 --> 00:02:08.319
Thank you.

